/// Converts 256 signed polynomial coefficients to canonical residues modulo q, preserving their field values.
///
/// # Safety
///
/// * `f` must be valid for reads and writes of 1024 bytes.
/// * Each coefficient, interpreted as a signed 32-bit integer, must be strictly between -8380417 and 8380417.
